# Boros Charm's second mode gives Bot1's permanents indestructible, Liliana of the Veil among them. Bot2's Lightning Bolt then
# removes all her loyalty (damage dealt to a planeswalker removes that many loyalty counters, CR 120.3c), and a planeswalker
# with no loyalty counters is put into its owner's graveyard by a state-based action that does not destroy it (CR 704.5i):
# indestructible does not help. The Ornithopter beside her, hit by nothing, simply keeps its indestructible.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Liliana of the Veil
Boros Charm
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Mountain
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

